# alien_prison_deep_cell.layout - giant empty cell with a torn-off door
#
# The bottom wall is the former door line: X marks torn door fragments,
# e marks the open entrance, and ^ marks the claw scars dragged across
# the cell floor. The room is intentionally empty and oversized.
